  "subject": {
    "id": "knowledge-pack-quantity-and-claim-text",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Classify quantities against QUDT and carry a claim by locator and digest.",
  "why": "Run-02's producer wrote 137 distinct strings into metrology's open quantity_kind for 137 observations, so a type-only binding could not sharpen, and put verbatim source sentences in Claim.statement, withholding seven artifacts. Decision 13 seeds enum QuantityKindClass: fifteen QUDT quantity-kind names spelled as QUDT spells them plus a local OTHER, cited at http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/. Optional slot quantity_kind_class joins the Quantified mixin beside quantity_kind, which stays open and keeps the source's wording. Decision 14 puts assertion_locator and statement_sha256 on research's SourceAsserted mixin, reaching Claim, Observation and any class inheriting Claim, as run-02's MechanismHypothesis does. Source gains licence; statement stays optional and carries a sentence only under a permitting licence. The locator is opaque and source-agnostic. Both packs are additive at 0.2.0. The compiler rejects pattern, so the digest shape is described, not enforced. The conformance rite is unchanged: its baseline is the caller's exact reference bytes, and a guard says so. paper-v4's input manifest pins the old pack digests and must be re-pinned by that thread."
}
